<% content_for :preheader, "A short, true word — landing in your inbox tomorrow morning." %>

<h1 style="font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif; font-size:24px; font-weight:500; color:#1B2A4E; margin:0 0 16px 0;">
  Glad you're here.
</h1>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">
  Starting tomorrow morning, you'll get one short devotional from us &mdash;
  a scripture, a thought, a quiet word to start the day. We aim for clear and true,
  never long.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">
  Want a head start? Today's devotional is already published:
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 32px 0;">
  <a href="<%= url_for(controller: "devotionals", action: "today", only_path: false, host: ENV["APP_HOST"].presence || "localhost") rescue root_url %>"
     style="display:inline-block; background-color:#1B2A4E; color:#FAF7F2; padding:12px 24px; border-radius:4px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:500;">
    Read today's devotional
  </a>
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;">
  Reply to this email any time &mdash; the inbox is read by a person.
</p>

<p style="margin:32px 0 0 0; font-size:13px; color:#8B7355;">
  Not for you? <a href="<%= @unsubscribe_url %>" style="color:#8B7355; text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe in one click</a>.
</p>
